lpha Mnemonicide working in the City. The game begins with him on his way to meet up with his new client, a girl named La. He is considered something of a prodigy, having graduated from his class at the Academy in only two years (the norm being anywhere from four to eight years). His powers are generally unrivaled within the City. He had a calm demeanor and is rarely fazed by anything."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c333"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6e00ec9222f9ce2721197dd0f1c3e9921303d453b552a94c318b69c254224320.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79c9b564c5ecd37aeef91c48d32332605d3c6873861828cdf218ce6d387b89d0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c334","characterName":"ラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c334"},"originalCharacterName":"ラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Main female character of the story. Mysterious girl who became Kurome's Guest. Always considerate, always making sure she is not in the way, and trying to make other people happy, she has an exceptionally pure heart and and an exceptionally strong will."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is Omega rank Mnemonicide."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c334"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26bc09e124d5543c9fd45348c02c10f3d0f04661348e718041acea1293dcb9cc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d2449765fe803c5e80f7eb0aeb0758e5d9fa8a5b58690a8305b79d95639a958.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c335","characterName":"アナライ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c335"},"originalCharacterName":"アナライ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Legendary Omega rank Mnemonicide."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c335"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c95e3ca8a6bd7f04fd260fb20e41b859301bb64d2947c603c4ff0521071e5c3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c4d9116f561feffedb881331d7d2027da850a667e96d8a31727aa0a31aeee8ae.webp","width":189,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3393","characterName":"イリーナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3393"},"originalCharacterName":"イリーナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young woman who comes under the care of Blackiris for treatment of The Dolor. Warm, sweet, and determined, Irina leaves quite an impression on La..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from site at insani.org"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3393"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/51/516c066149af7cb3841b5a34fe4a0308d62493257055572c19a88c9047822a95.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb58fd33ca6a924408b61df1fb37ae106712d5bb728d284a7b383f700e796b7d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3394","characterName":"リップス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3394"},"originalCharacterName":"リップス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young lady Mnemonicide currently on service in the City."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from site at insani.org"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3394"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3a9951ce27731990859cae9efebe13bd0b2d74a3c9c207c672f290c8230f5ba.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c52623992ee59f520c8b36c5eb8fbda63ac21f359ef274183f1a6fdc8fb77c28.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3396","characterName":"キョウ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3396"},"originalCharacterName":"キョウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"If you asked this brash young man what he did, he'd tell you with a toothy grin that he runs one of the most famous eateries within or without City limits; however, the truth of the matter is that almost no one visits his little cafe."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"What is indisputably true, however, is that he's a genius chef ― and that he'd probably be wildly successful if he chose to open a restaurant outside of the City. Extremely fond of games of any kind, he can usually be found trying to scare up a game of chess, Othello, cards ― you name it, he's a deft hand at them all."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Many people mistake his easygoing, devil-may-care demeanor for sloth ― but those who make his acquaintance soon come to realize that he's a living dynamo, working on a scary (and dangerous) number of side projects and side jobs at the same time. Considers himself a consummate ladies' man, but nothing could be farther from the truth. One of only a handful of people that Blackiris entirely trusts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from site at insani.org"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3396"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da492a56698891d3e7e7cc06d31dedf107fbd0408d24a7a7e633483777fc0a14.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8eefb9575561cf00e47b7b6565986e80bf91be660d994d9d44815b49b37c4589.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3397","characterName":"マルシェロ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3397"},"originalCharacterName":"マルシェロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"15"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young man from a rich and influential family who comes under the care of Blackiris for treatment of The Dolor. Brash, arrogant, timid, impatient, and impressionable all at once, he is fixated on Class Alpha Mnemonicides."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from site at insani.org"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3397"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/0868de3baa41701d085298f5c64c418697ac2b7d6909230f01ebec091d446ce1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1